    <section class="about" id="about">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT US</p>
      <h2>Welcome to CryptoTrade KE</h2>
      <p>
        Our goal is to make cryptocurrency information and
        digital finance education more accessible to the
        Kenyan community.
      </p>
